# vox-agent on the live engine (CT 600, 10.10.0.21): the non-secret lines of /etc/vox-agent.env as set on 2026-11-14 (docs/BUILD-LOG.md,
# protections part A). The file there also holds VOX_AGENT_SECRET (never here). agent/install.sh keeps the engine's file on an update; to
# change a line, give it on the command line, e.g.
#   agent/install.sh root@10.10.0.21 <key> 10.10.0.21:8781 status,cache/delete,check
# Not set yet, to add with the next agent update (audit VOX-B-3): VOX_AGENT_DOMAINS=<HUEPC's domain name>, so checks are refused for any
# other customer's domain on this engine.
VOX_AGENT_BIND=10.10.0.21:8781
VOX_AGENT_OPERATIONS=status,cache/delete,check
